      "parameters": {},
      "result_summary": "用于确认PSBPhBr的单取代结构、官能化程度，有机硼喹啉聚合物的结构与硼中心四配位状态，以及共聚物的官能度。",
      "derived_property_ids": [
        "prop_s5_001"
      ],
      "evidence": [
        {
          "block_id": "P_1_19",
          "page": 1,
          "bbox": [
            81.0,
            594.0,
            483.0,
            959.0
          ],
          "source_type": "text",
          "source_sentence": "Transfer of a single phenyl group to the boron moieties was evident from multinuclear NMR spectroscopy and further confirmed by comparison of the polymer data withthoseofthecorrespondingmolecularcompound(<sup>t</sup>BuPh)<sub>2</sub>BBr.<sup>22</sup> Integration of the $\\mathrm { \\hat { \\Pi } } ^ { 1 } \\mathrm { H }$NMR spectrum of PSBPhBr was consistent with the presence of one tert-butylphenyl group per repeat unit of the polymer."
        },
        {
          "block_id": "P_1_22",
          "page": 1,
          "bbox": [
            511.0,
            803.0,
            915.0,
            958.0
          ],
          "source_type": "text",
          "source_sentence": "The organoboron quinolate polymers were fully characterized by <sup>1</sup>H, $^ { 1 3 } \\mathrm { C } ,$and $^ { 1 1 } \\mathrm { B }$NMR spectroscopy. Sharp signals in the $^ { 1 1 } \\mathrm { B }$NMR spectra at ca. 7 ppm $( w _ { 1 / 2 } = 3 5 0 – 5 7 0$Hz) confirm the tetracoordinated nature of the boron centers."
        },
        {
          "block_id": "P_4_51",
          "page": 4,
          "bbox": [
            81.0,
            371.0,
            483.0,
            789.0
          ],
          "source_type": "text",
          "source_sentence": "The degree of functionalization for the isolated copolymer PSBPhQ-H-co-PSSiMe was calculated to be 10.5% according to <sup>1</sup>H NMR integration and 12.8% according to GPC-MALLS, which is very close to the feed ratio of BBr<sub>3</sub> to $\\mathrm { S i M e } _ { 3 }$functional groups."
        }
      ],
      "confidence": {
        "score": 0.9
      }
    },
    {
